<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6470 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6470 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6470 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Monday from 4.6500 on March 20.</p>
<p>				   Mar 24	Mar 20</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6470	4.6500</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   600,000     900,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
